msgid "`translation:status` writes `review.html` beside the status page. Every site build, wherever the checkout has translations, publishes `assets/translation-status/review.json` (`folio-translation-review/v1`: every catalogue × locale, its state, and the hash of the catalogue's bytes) and, per catalogue, its strings projection (`folio-translation-strings/v1`: every string in every locale, its status, its candidates ranked, and the default pick) — `publish-translation-review.ts`, run by the site build. The catalogue hash is what an adjudication is pinned to; the strings projection is what a block's 🌐 pane draws."
msgstr ""

