#: library/processes/translation-review-adjudication.bpmn:254
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A chosen suggestion becomes the string's `msgstr`, not fuzzy, and its sidecar entry's `chosen` records `how: adjudicated`, by whom, when, in which issue, why, and which candidate. `acceptable`: the catalogue's translation node gets `signedOffBy` / `signedOffAt`, and each fuzzy string in it is adjudicated as it stands. Each adjudication appends an entry to the catalogue's `translation-qa` attestation (criterion `human-adjudication`) naming the issue and the hash the person saw, and a proposal one under `human-proposal`; the attestation is append-only and checked against `qa-attestations/v1` before it is written. The PO header `X-Folio-Official` and the locale's `status.json` are never touched."
msgstr ""

#: library/processes/translation-review-adjudication.bpmn:79
