#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Every refusal, with its reason, as a comment on the issue (exit 3). No pull request is opened. A refusal is never a partial record dressed as a whole one; a new review is a new issue and a new instance of this process."
msgstr ""

#: library/processes/translation-review-adjudication.bpmn:218
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Every suggestion, whoever filed it, is appended to the catalogue's `translation-candidates/v1` sidecar as `{kind: \"human\", id: \"github:<login>\", by, issue}`, with the `msgidHash` of the string it translates and its placeholder QA. A proposal is never refused for a changed catalogue and never conflicts with another: the sidecar keeps them all, ranked side by side. A record that does not parse, or that names another repository or another translations directory, is refused here."
msgstr ""

